### ========================================
### CLIENTE SERVICE - Pruebas completas
### ========================================

### 1. Crear Cliente
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "Ramírez",
  "email": "carlos.ramirez@example.com",
  "region": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### 2. Crear otro Cliente
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "García",
  "email": "ana.garcia@example.com",
  "region": {
    "id": 2
  }
}

### 3. Listar todos los clientes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes

### 4. Obtener cliente por ID existente
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/1

### 5. Probar error 404 de Codelab 04 (Cliente no encontrado)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/999

### 6. Actualizar cliente
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos Andrés",
  "apellido": "Ramírez López",
  "email": "carlos.ramirez@example.com",
  "region": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### 7. Eliminar cliente
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/cliente-service/clientes/1